+// COGBox SDK patch 55 (GitHub #95 / #97): controllers only (never the keyboard-and-mouse device), before the devices are
+// merged and before patch 38.
+//  - pad_radial_deadzone: a round dead zone on both sticks (the stick's distance from centre, not each axis on its
+//    own), rescaled so movement starts from 0 at its edge - Gears 3's feel for Gears 1 and 2. 0 = off.
+//  - pad_remap: the controller's buttons moved, "src=dst,src=dst" with a b x y lb rb lt rt ls rs back start up down
